<slide>
  footer: off
</slide>

## This slide has no footer

`footer: off` in the `<slide>` block hides the bar for one slide, for example in front of a full-screen demo.
The bar fades out and the built-in slide counter comes back. The space stays reserved, so nothing on the slide moves when a bar appears or disappears.

<notes>
  Same for header: off.
</notes>
